(OVERVIEW) Tj
T*
(SubTrack tracks recurring subscriptions, billing dates, payment activity, account balance, and) Tj
T*
(notifications. This PDF documents the Java migration on master. Main is not modified.) Tj
T*
(Current Java features: registration/login, BCrypt password hashing, JWT creation, subscription) Tj
T*
(CRUD/status, balance-backed payment recording, notifications, and health endpoint.) Tj
T*
(This is a migration baseline, not a production-ready payment or identity service.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
/F2 10 Tf
(ARCHITECTURE AND STACK) Tj
T*
(React + TypeScript + Vite client -> HTTP/JSON -> Spring Boot REST API -> Spring Data JPA -> MySQL.) Tj
T*
(Backend: Java 21, Spring Boot 3.5.6, Spring Web, Spring Data JPA, Jakarta Validation, Spring) Tj
T*
(Security, Maven, Hibernate, MySQL Connector/J. Client: React, TypeScript, Vite, Axios, React Router,) Tj
T*
(React Hook Form, Tailwind CSS, Recharts.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Source layout: Client/ frontend; Server/pom.xml Maven build; Server/src/main/java/com/subtrack/) Tj
T*
(contains config, controller, dto, entity, repository, security; Server/src/main/resources contains) Tj
T*
(application properties; Documentation/ contains API and development notes.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
/F2 10 Tf
(DOMAIN MODEL) Tj
T*
(User: UUID, username, email, BCrypt password hash, balance, created timestamp, role.) Tj
T*
(Subscription: user UUID, name, amount, category, billing cycle/status, next billing timestamp.) Tj
T*
(Payment: user/subscription UUIDs, amount, status, payment timestamp, unique transaction reference.) Tj
T*
(Notification: owner, title/message/type, read state and creation metadata.) Tj
T*
(Money uses BigDecimal; timestamps use Instant. Billing cycles: Monthly, Quarterly, HalfYearly, Yearly.) Tj
T*
(Subscription statuses: Active, Paused, Cancelled. Payment statuses: PENDING, SUCCESS, FAILED.) Tj
ET
