(LOCAL DEVELOPMENT) Tj
T*
/F1 9 Tf
(Prerequisites: JDK 21, Maven 3.9+, MySQL 8-compatible server, Node.js/npm compatible with Vite.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Clone and select Java branch:) Tj
T*
(  git clone https://github.com/chauhan12harsh/Subtrack.git) Tj
T*
(  cd Subtrack) Tj
T*
(  git switch master) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Create MySQL schema named subtrack or configure DB_URL. Hibernate ddl-auto=validate checks mappings) Tj
T*
(against an existing schema; it does not create or migrate tables. No Flyway/Liquibase migration is) Tj
T*
(currently included. Confirm schema mappings before startup.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
/F2 10 Tf
(ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES) Tj
T*
(SERVER_PORT  HTTP port; default 8080) Tj
T*
(DB_URL       JDBC URL; default jdbc:mysql://localhost:3306/subtrack) Tj
T*
(DB_USERNAME  database user; default root) Tj
T*
(DB_PASSWORD  database password; default empty) Tj
T*
(JWT_SECRET   HS256 signing secret; minimum 32 characters for token creation) Tj
T*
(JWT_ISSUER   issuer claim; default subtrack) Tj
T*
(JWT_AUDIENCE configured default subtrack-client; currently not emitted or validated) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Example \(use local values; never commit secrets\):) Tj
T*
(  export DB_URL='jdbc:mysql://localhost:3306/subtrack') Tj
T*
(  export DB_USERNAME='root') Tj
T*
(  export DB_PASSWORD='your-local-password') Tj
T*
(  export JWT_SECRET='replace-with-a-long-random-development-secret') Tj
T*
(  export SERVER_PORT=8080) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Run backend: cd Server && mvn spring-boot:run) Tj
T*
(Run frontend in another terminal: cd Client && npm install && npm run dev) Tj
T*
(Health check: GET http://localhost:8080/health) Tj
ET
endstream
